OBS_ADDRESS=ws://000.00.000.0:0000
OBS_PASSWORD=password


--- IGNORE ---
ws://000.00.000.0: will be the server IP address from OBS
:0000 will be the port number from OBS
password will be the password you set in OBS WebSocket settings

all this info can be found in obs websocket settings under "Tools" in OBS

be sure to rename the file to just ".env"